## 5. 必背伪代码

### 5.1 ZEM 初始化

```ts
function getEnvironment() {
  if (process.env.NODE_ENV === 'development') return 'dev';

  const { miniProgram } = Taro.getAccountInfoSync();

  if (miniProgram.envVersion === 'develop') return 'dev';
  if (miniProgram.envVersion === 'trial') return 'uat';
  return 'prod';
}

const zemClient = createZEMClient({
  appKey: 'mini_pick',
  environment: getEnvironment(),
  version: getMiniProgramVersion(),
  enable: process.env.NODE_ENV === 'production',
  debug: getEnvironment() !== 'prod',
});
```

讲法：

> 初始化阶段就做环境隔离、版本标记和生产开关，避免开发数据污染线上报表。

### 5.2 App 全局注入

```tsx
function App({ children }) {
  const refetchUser = useUserStore(state => state.refetch);

  useLaunch(() => {
    refetchUser();
  });

  return (
    <QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>
      <ZEMProvider client={zemClient}>
        {children}
      </ZEMProvider>
    </QueryClientProvider>
  );
}
```

讲法：

> ZEMProvider 让页面里能使用 `useTrackClick` 和 `useTrackPageView`。`useLaunch` 用来启动时恢复用户状态。

### 5.3 页面曝光

```tsx
let lastPath: string | undefined;

function PageLayout({ title, children }) {
  const router = useRouter();
  const trackPageView = useTrackPageView();

  useDidShow(() => {
    const { $taroTimestamp, ...params } = router.params;

    trackPageView(router.path, title || router.path, {
      ...params,
      _track_from: lastPath,
    });

    lastPath = router.path;
  });

  return <Page title={title}>{children}</Page>;
}
```

讲法：

> 小程序返回页面时不一定重新 mount，所以曝光用 `useDidShow` 而不是 `useEffect`。

### 5.4 登录用户身份绑定

```ts
async function handleLoginSuccess() {
  const user = await getCurrentUser();

  zemClient.identify({
    userId: user.id,
    userName: user.username,
  });

  zemClient.logger.info('mobileNumber', {
    mobileNumber: user.mobileNumber,
  });

  setUser(user);
}
```

讲法：

> identify 绑定强身份，手机号作为业务日志补充，方便按用户或手机号排查。

### 5.5 取件码免登录身份

```ts
async function handleCodeConfirm(verifyCode) {
  clearVehiclePartitionCache();

  const res = await getOrderByCode(verifyCode);
  const firstOrder = res.dispatch.orderList[0];

  if (!firstOrder) {
    showToast('暂无货单信息');
    return;
  }

  zemClient.identify({
    userId: '',
    userName: firstOrder.name,
  });

  zemClient.logger.info('mobileNumber', {
    mobileNumber: firstOrder.contact,
  });

  navigateTo('/pages/orderList/index', {
    type: 'CODE',
    vehicleName: res.name,
    verifyCode,
  });
}
```

讲法：

> 取件码链路不要求登录，所以用收件人信息做弱身份，避免免登录链路变成匿名黑盒。

### 5.6 请求异常

```ts
async function request(config) {
  const finalConfig = await runRequestInterceptors(config);
  const response = await Taro.request(finalConfig);

  if (response.statusCode < 200 || response.statusCode >= 300) {
    reportException(new RequestError({
      statusCode: response.statusCode,
      url: finalConfig.url,
      method: finalConfig.method,
      data: finalConfig.data,
      response: response.data,
    }));

    throw new RequestError('HTTP 请求失败');
  }

  response.config = finalConfig;
  return runResponseInterceptors(response);
}
```

讲法：

> HTTP 非 2xx 在请求底座统一处理，页面不用每个接口单独写异常埋点。

### 5.7 业务异常

```ts
function responseFulfilled(response) {
  const { success, isSuccess, data, message, errorCode } = response.data;

  if (success || isSuccess) {
    return data;
  }

  reportException(new ServerException({
    message,
    code: errorCode,
    url: response.config.url,
    method: response.config.method,
    extra: {
      data: response.config.data,
    },
  }));

  showToast(message);
  throw new ServerError(message, errorCode);
}
```

讲法：

> HTTP 200 不代表业务成功，所以还要看 `success/isSuccess`。

### 5.8 网络异常

```ts
function responseRejected(error, config) {
  try {
    reportException(new NetworkException({
      message: error.message || error.errMsg,
      code: error.code,
      url: config.url,
      method: config.method,
      extra: {
        data: config.data,
        status: error.response?.status,
      },
    }));
  } catch (reportError) {
    reportException(new UnknownException(reportError));
  }

  throw normalizeNetworkError(error);
}
```

讲法：

> 网络异常和上报过程自己的异常也要兜住，但埋点不能阻断主流程。

### 5.9 车辆分区路由

```ts
const VEHICLE_HEADER = 'X-Partition-Vehicle';
const partitionCache = new Map();

request.interceptors.request.use(async config => {
  const vehicleName = config.headers?.[VEHICLE_HEADER];
  if (!vehicleName) return config;

  let partitionPromise = partitionCache.get(vehicleName);
  if (!partitionPromise) {
    partitionPromise = getPartitionByVehicle(vehicleName);
    partitionCache.set(vehicleName, partitionPromise);
  }

  const partition = await partitionPromise;

  if (partition?.gatewayHost) {
    config.baseURL = `https://${partition.gatewayHost}`;
  }

  return config;
});

function clearVehiclePartitionCache() {
  partitionCache.clear();
}
```

讲法：

> 车辆分区是取货业务的关键上下文。请求发错分区，就可能查不到单或开不了箱。

### 5.10 扫码取货

```ts
function handleScan(mobileNumber) {
  if (!mobileNumber) {
    navigateTo('/pages/login/index');
    return;
  }

  Taro.scanCode({
    onlyFromCamera: true,
    scanType: 'QR_CODE',
    success: async res => {
      const vehicleName =
        parseVehicleName(res.result) ||
        (await getZelosVehicleName(res.result)).name;

      clearVehiclePartitionCache();

      const orderResult = await getOrderByPhone(vehicleName, mobileNumber);
      const orderList = orderResult.dispatch.orderList || [];

      if (!orderList.length) {
        showToast('暂无货单信息');
        return;
      }

      navigateTo('/pages/orderList/index', {
        type: 'PHONE',
        vehicleName,
        mobileNumber,
      });
    },
  });
}
```

讲法：

> 扫码后不是直接开箱，而是先解析车辆名、查货单、再进入货单列表。

### 5.11 开箱与完成取件

```ts
async function handleOpenBox(vehicleName, gridNos, orderIds, autoOpen) {
  try {
    startCountdown();
    await openBox(vehicleName, gridNos, autoOpen);
    await updateStatus(vehicleName, orderIds);
  } catch (error) {
    stopCountdown();
    throw error;
  }
}

async function handleConfirmComplete(vehicleName, orderList) {
  const orderIds = orderList.map(order => order.id);

  await batchCompletePick(vehicleName, orderIds);

  if (shouldSubscribe) {
    showSubscribeConfirm();
  } else {
    reLaunch('/pages/index/index');
  }
}
```

讲法：

> 开门只是动作，开箱接口成功后还要更新订单状态；完成取件要走 `batchCompletePick`。

### 5.12 订阅消息

```ts
Taro.requestSubscribeMessage({
  tmplIds: [CODE_TEMP_ID, VEHICLE_TEMP_ID],
  success(res) {
    logger.info('requestSubscribeMessageSuccess', res);
  },
  fail(res) {
    logger.info('requestSubscribeMessageFail', res);
  },
  complete(res) {
    logger.info('requestSubscribeMessageComplete', res);
    reLaunch('/pages/index/index');
  },
});
```

讲法：

> 订阅消息必须由用户动作触发，所以放在完成取件确认后的流程里。

